WEBVTT

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:14.510
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:18.750
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:22.150
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.190
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:29.130
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:41.840
What do you want?
Are you on a mission to eliminate me?

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:46.140
No. l've come to settle things, Papillon.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.280
ln Kazuki's place.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:50.850
No one can replace him...

00:00:51.290 --> 00:01:02.290
Do you have a replacement?!
For Kazuki Muto?!

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:09.200
<i>Period</i>

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.000
Tokiko Senpai!

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:15.270
Look out!

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:20.750
Tokiko!

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.520
There's no replacement for Kazuki.

00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:29.290
Nobody could replace Kazuki. l know that.

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:38.530
But even so, the least l can do, is to settle things with you.

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:43.300
Here l go.

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:53.240
Activation device normal, pressure device normal,

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:55.410
heat capacity device normal.

00:01:55.990 --> 00:02:03.050
Exactly 60 seconds remaining. 59, 58...57, 56...

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:05.060
<i>This is a countdown timer!</i>

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:08.120
Papillon...What's that flask?

00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:11.160
Don't tell me...!

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:14.660
Don't interfere...

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:16.270
Do you really intend to?

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:18.600
<i>Sure enough,</i> <i>as l thought about before,</i>

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:21.470
<i>it'd probably be best to just burn</i> <i>this world to the ground</i>

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.840
<i>and then create a world</i> <i>comfortable for me.</i>

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:26.680
Do you really intend to burn this world to the ground?

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:30.850
l have no interest in a world without Kazuki Muto.

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:34.120
Koshaku Chono!

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:36.650
Don't you ever call me by that name!

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:38.090
Near Death Happiness!

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:44.830
Tokiko!

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:55.040
Below...huh?

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:57.340
<i>What?!</i>

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.810
Even without Kazuki here,

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:08.150
this is still the world he risked his life to protect!

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:23.240
5, 4, 3...

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:27.370
2, 1, countdown 0.

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:31.710
White kakugane.

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.410
Refinement complete.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.390
That flask is...?

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:51.730
lt was built to quickly and safely refine the white kakugane.

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:53.790
My master spent the past month creating it

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:56.240
with every knowledge and resource available,

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:59.640
basing it on the technology left behind by Dr. Butterfly and Dr. Alexandria...

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:04.980
My master's only desire is a showdown with Kazuki Muto.

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:08.170
The white kakugane is for that purpose.

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:10.480
But...

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:13.350
Kazuki is no longer...

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.260
Can you give up on him?

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:19.890
Can you give up completely...

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:24.000
on Kazuki Muto?

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:36.510
Kazu...ki...

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:51.350
Muto...

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.320
ls that the moonlight?

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:57.130
No...

00:04:59.270 --> 00:04:59.960
That's...

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:02.500
That's...!

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:03.670
—That's...!
—That's...!

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:04.710
Great Warrior Chief!

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:05.640
That's...!

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:07.040
Mahiro!

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.470
—Mahiro!
—Mahiro!

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:09.780
Look at the moon, the moon!

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:11.250
—The moon?
—Look at that! That!

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.810
A beautiful sunlight yellow light...

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:20.820
That's...

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:26.760
<i>Did you know that the color of</i> <i>your Buso Renkin energy up close</i>

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:31.320
<i>is a bright yellow resembling sunlight?</i>

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.030
Can it be...

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:38.940
I'll explain later! Come with me!

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:40.540
Why are you here?

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.170
Let's go. Are you ready?

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:43.470
Go? Go where?

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:46.740
Sakimori will take the right shoulder.

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:49.010
Hiwatari and Busujima, take the left.

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:53.750
Great Warrior Chief! What's going on?

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:55.460
Ah, you have arrived.

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:58.220
You are getting on too.

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:02.090
We will now be heading to pick up
Warrior Kazuki Muto!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.660
Upper hatch release complete.

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:07.330
<i>Adjusting emission angle.</i>

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.830
Confirming heat resistance and air treatment.

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:11.800
<i>All green! Ready to go at any time!</i>

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.200
Okay, please begin.

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:18.070
Gas Mask Buso Renkin,
Aerial Operator!

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:20.070
Beginning Gas Manipulation!

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:24.480
Mixing oxygen, injecting into gas compound gun sack.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:28.010
Blaze of Glory!

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:29.930
Connecting to gun sack!

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.520
Buster Barron, blast off.

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:14.640
You still continue to stand?

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:17.400
This battle has long since been settled!

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:19.800
N-Not yet.

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:24.480
l won't give up, no matter what!

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:29.380
<i>Let's settle things, Victor!</i>

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:33.320
l will protect my friends...!

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:41.890
and Tokiko, no matter what!

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:57.010
I'll protect. I'll protect them!

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.640
Victor!

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:05.510
The fight is over.

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:08.710
You go back to the Earth.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:11.390
Look...

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:15.330
What's that?

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:17.700
lt's your comrades.

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:22.230
They detected that sparkle of yours from the ground.

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:24.610
Victor!

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:28.870
lt appears they've changed during this one month.

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:31.540
They saw that light,

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:34.920
figured out that you're alive and here on this land,

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.380
and are attempting to come here.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:40.850
lt would be absolutely impossible

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:43.980
for those human bodies to get here with a Buso Renkin.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.850
You have to go meet up with them from here.

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:50.490
However, it'd probably be impossible for you

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:54.330
to burst through the gravity of this moon with your spear in that condition.

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:56.970
So we'll use this.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:02.080
I'll reverse a portion of the gravity of this moon with the Fatal Attraction...

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:05.210
and shoot you off into space.

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:08.810
Victor, why are you doing this...?

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:10.250
Close your mouth.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:11.580
You'll bite your tongue.

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:14.650
Victor! What's this?!

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:20.160
The property of Fatal Attraction does not have a direct effect on my body.

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:22.290
And more importantly,

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:25.930
l don't have the energy left to shoot off the light of both of us.

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:31.570
Go. The people you protected are awaiting your return.

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:32.940
Now, get going!

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:34.740
What?!

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:38.840
No way! You're coming, too!
Victoria is waiting for you!

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.240
lf you no longer intend to fight,

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:44.290
then let's search for a new path to co-exist together, Victor!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:45.150
Hurry!

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:49.320
l won't take responsibility for what you're doing.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.130
<i>Under similar circumstances...</i>

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:57.820
<i>one man clung to despair...</i>

00:09:59.940 --> 00:10:02.130
<i>and one man didn't let go of hope.</i>

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:09.980
<i>No way could despair</i> <i>ever defeat hope.</i>

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:17.780
Damn it, Shousei.

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:21.820
We can't navigate with a rocket engine we just whipped up.

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:24.360
There's a limit to how much l can follow up with the gas injection.

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:27.890
Be quiet! Up ahead, in front of the moon.

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:31.920
That's...!

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:32.930
Kazuki!

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:43.040
l can't choose one or the other.
I'll protect both.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:47.910
I'll protect everyone, so someone please protect me...

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:49.720
Kazuki!

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:52.140
Buster Baron, approach and acquire!

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:54.150
We can't do something that delicate, l tell you!

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:56.690
lf something goes wrong, we could end up blowing him off into space!

00:10:57.690 --> 00:11:00.690
lt's your turn. Now, go pick him up.

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:23.520
Kazuki...

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:27.380
The Silver Skin... Bravo...?

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:30.160
No, it's not. That's...!

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:32.090
Kazuki!

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:33.690
Tokiko!

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:39.200
<i>The time you die is when l die.</i>

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:43.070
<i>No... I'll live on with you.</i>

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:45.870
<i>l won't leave you anymore.</i>

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:55.910
<i>This time for sure, you and l are one...</i>

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:22.210
Adjusting atmospheric pressure, cooling off heat friction.

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:24.440
Buster Baron, landing complete.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:40.430
Daddy...

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:44.120
Are you okay?

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:45.600
l think so...

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:50.300
<i>lf it means your smile will return,</i>
<i>I'll do anything.</i>

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:52.930
<i>lf it means your smile will return...</i>

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:59.880
<i>l'm really happy for you,</i>
<i>Tokiko Senpai...</i>

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:08.720
Kazuki Muto!

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:17.390
This is...!

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:23.500
You remember... our promise, don't you..?

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:25.470
Yeah.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:43.790
—Let's settle things.
—Let's settle things.

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:45.560
—Buso...Renkin!
—Buso...Renkin!

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.580
Kazuki!

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:06.910
Do it. And don't mess it up this time.

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:14.720
We made this by analyzing the device
Papillon left behind.

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:16.340
Please use this.

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:29.800
Victoria.

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:36.430
What were Alexandria's... your mom's...final words?

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:44.080
<i>Victoria... Tell your father</i> <i>if you see him again.</i>

00:15:46.950 --> 00:15:52.120
<i>Tell him that l will</i>
<i>...always love him.</i>

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:56.820
Great Warrior Chief.

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:59.250
l have a request.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:03.930
Please make me into the same homunculus as my daughter.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:09.430
The homunculus is an existence incompatible with humans.

00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:12.640
l will take the other homunculi and make my way to the moon.

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:17.410
And we will dream of the day when we can return to being humans...

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:21.470
and watch over the world from afar while praying...

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:26.350
that the power of alchemy is not misused.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:31.860
Alchemist Army activity will be suspended for the time being.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:35.130
The research on returning homunculi into human form

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:37.330
and management of the kakugane will continue.

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:40.800
Every warrior's kakugane will be collected.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:46.140
l will remain in the Army. l guess this is goodbye.

00:16:46.910 --> 00:16:49.400
But if you do something that makes
Tokiko cry again...

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:52.610
l won't. Never again.

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:57.580
That's good.
Then you and l are comrades forever.

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:00.450
<i>lt's time for Jump News.</i>

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:04.690
<i>Our feature today is the new urban legend</i> <i>following the man-faced dog.</i>

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:08.290
<i>We covered the story on the much</i> <i>talked-about butterfly man Papillon.</i>

00:17:08.530 --> 00:17:11.430
<i>Papillon? Yeah, l saw him at</i> <i>the public bath last month.</i>

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:15.030
<i>That guy, huh? l don't think</i> <i>l'd be able to forget him.</i>

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:17.730
<i>Yes, we see him once a week.</i>

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:20.100
<i>We now have a butterfly man promotion.</i>

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:21.110
<i>We look forward to your support.</i>

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:23.580
<i>lf you call out on a roof</i> <i>or some high place...</i>

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:26.170
<i>The rumor is he often shows himself.</i>

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:32.350
<i>As you can see, here in Ginsei known</i> <i>as his place of origin,</i>

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:36.190
<i>there's a sense of friendship.</i>

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:40.330
<i>What is the identity of</i> <i>the butterfly man Papillon?</i>

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:42.300
<i>What in the world is his purpose?</i>

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:52.000
Chono... do you still wish to eat people,

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:55.310
and to burn this world to the ground?

00:17:57.480 --> 00:17:59.810
<i>l'd heard that you didn't have</i> <i>any urges for cannibalism,</i>

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:01.470
<i>but it seems it's true.</i>

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:06.520
<i>My master's only desire is</i> <i>a showdown with Kazuki Muto.</i>

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:10.020
Chono...

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:13.630
l don't want to kill you again.

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:17.560
This is how l choose to settle things with you.

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:22.470
Enough with taking each other's lives.

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:27.300
l wish there was a Buso Renkin to bring people back to life,

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.840
but there is no such thing.

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:34.710
So let's mourn for the lives lost and end it all here.

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:39.580
You're even more a hypocrite now than ever.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:44.090
That's fine. lt's much better than me killing you.

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:49.660
Chono, I'll always remember your name.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:53.770
I'll always, always remember who you are.

00:18:54.870 --> 00:19:00.100
So please live in a new world with a new name and life.

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:12.480
Papillon, Papillon, Papillon, Papillon!

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:17.720
Tsk-tsk...Papillon. Yes.

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:20.760
Put more love into it!

00:19:21.060 --> 00:19:25.360
Papillon! Papillon! Papillon!

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:29.260
That Chono's sure enjoying himself.

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:32.670
ls your body really okay?

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:36.430
Yeah. l'm totally fine.
Are you okay, Tokiko?

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:38.970
You seem kind of fidgety and restless.

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:43.450
Well, the kakugane was a part of me,

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:47.820
so l'm kind of uneasy not having it now.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:50.980
lt's okay!

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:55.220
The kakugane right here will always be with you, Tokiko.

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:59.730
l see. Then l'm sure l can rest easy.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:08.310
We left here for a world of battle.
And now we're back here.

00:20:09.110 --> 00:20:11.080
Oh! Here they come! l knew they'd be back!

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:13.250
—Big Brother.
—Kazuki!

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:16.280
Tokiko! Welcome back!

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:19.920
Let's go, Tokiko!

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:20.370
Mahiro Muto's Buso Renkin Seminar!

00:22:21.810 --> 00:22:23.680
Hello, this is Mahiro Muto!

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:26.740
Today's our last day for this seminar

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:29.980
where we introduced all sorts of Buso Renkin...

00:22:30.520 --> 00:22:33.250
And here's a blasting introduction of a Buso Renkin

00:22:33.320 --> 00:22:35.520
fitting for the final episode!

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:39.590
Today, our final, Buso Renkin is...

00:22:39.660 --> 00:22:42.260
Sunlight Heart Plus!

00:22:42.760 --> 00:22:46.200
You already know who's Buso Renkin this is, right?

00:22:46.500 --> 00:22:51.370
The wielder is...
Yup! My big brother, Kazuki Muto!

00:22:52.040 --> 00:22:54.510
The reason behind the Sunlight Heart's transformation is

00:22:54.580 --> 00:22:57.740
Kazuki's "Victorization" from the black kakugane,

00:22:57.810 --> 00:23:00.340
and in response, the Sunlight Heart also evolved as well.

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:02.750
lt still takes the form of a lance,

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:05.550
but the size is more compact than before.

00:23:05.950 --> 00:23:07.480
Kazuki told me the weight is also much lighter

00:23:07.560 --> 00:23:11.580
and can be easily handled with one arm!

00:23:12.230 --> 00:23:17.690
Even so, Kazuki's favorite ultra reckless energy attack is still at it's best!

00:23:17.870 --> 00:23:21.740
The Sunlight Heart Plus is an energy built-in type Buso Renkin,

00:23:21.800 --> 00:23:25.900
and is able to control its shape and size freely by dismantling the lance tip!

00:23:26.270 --> 00:23:29.680
l see, so it's not the Decorative Cloth like before.

00:23:29.740 --> 00:23:34.380
But Kazuki's energy extends far and beyond

00:23:34.450 --> 00:23:38.320
and still remains a beautiful sunlight yellow light.

00:23:38.550 --> 00:23:42.650
Boy, back when Kazuki was Victorized

00:23:42.720 --> 00:23:44.780
we were all worried what was going to happen.

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:48.820
But thanks to the white kakugane that can neutralize the black kakugane,

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:50.300
he is all back to normal!

00:23:50.630 --> 00:23:54.660
Pappy is the one who made
Kazuki's white kakugane, right?

00:23:54.740 --> 00:23:56.640
l should remember to thank Pappy the next time l see him!

00:23:57.040 --> 00:24:01.030
lt seems a lot has happened, but no matter what happened,

00:24:01.110 --> 00:24:03.540
my big brother was still the big brother l knew!

00:24:03.680 --> 00:24:07.080
Ever reliable, and always there for everyone!

00:24:07.480 --> 00:24:10.850
But you better not make
Tokiko cry again!

00:24:11.620 --> 00:24:17.820
And so! Everyone's now totally familiar with the Buso Renkin, right?

00:24:18.160 --> 00:24:21.820
That makes everybody a master of Buso Renkin!

00:24:22.500 --> 00:24:25.130
Thank you for watching everyone!

00:24:25.200 --> 00:24:27.970
l hope to see you all somewhere!

00:24:28.140 --> 00:24:30.110
Bye!
